{% set employee = frappe.get_doc("Employee", doc.employee) %}
{% set course_title = frappe.db.get_value("LMS Course", doc.course, "title") if doc.course else "" %}
{% set template = frappe.call("lms.overrides.documents.get_employee_declaration_template", employee_doc=employee, course_name=doc.course, course_title=course_title) %}
{% set company_name = template['company'] %}
{% set relationship_company = template['relationship_company'] %}
{% set bullets = template['bullets'] %}
<article>
  <header>
    <img src="/assets/lms/images/meril.svg" alt="meril-logo" />
    <h2 class="title">Employee Declaration - Ethical Practices &amp; Compliance</h2>
  </header>
  <p>I hereby declare that I have undergone and understood training provided on Ethical Practices and compliance. As a responsible employee of {{ company_name }}, I acknowledge and accept the duty to comply with the procedural frameworks developed and adopted by the Meril&#8217;s Management from time to time.</p>
  <p>I have been thoroughly informed on the various Code of Conduct that govern the ethical operation of Meril&#8217;s business, which I agree to follow diligently. I have read, understood and consent to abide by the following Codes of Conduct on a consensus-ad-idem basis:</p>
  <ol>
  {% for point in bullets %}
    <li>{{ point }}</li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  <p>I hereby confirm that I shall adhere in all respects to the ethics and standards of conduct outlined in the above Codes of Conduct. I understand that any violation or even potential violation of the Codes of Conduct / Policies may result in disciplinary action, including termination of my employment.</p>
  <p>I certify that I am not currently in violation of any of the aforementioned Codes of Conduct.</p>
  <p>Furthermore, I declare that I have no direct or indirect familial, financial, or other relationships with any distributor or nominated representative of the distributor. Should I become aware of any such relationship in the future, I commit to disclosing it to {{ relationship_company }} within thirty (30) days from the date of awareness.</p>
  <p>I also declare that I will not engage in any financial transactions with any distributor or nominated representative of the distributor. I acknowledge that Meril Group shall bear no responsibility or liability for any such transactions.</p>
  <div class="info">Employee Name : {{ employee.employee_name }}</div>
  <div class="info">Employee ID : {{ employee.custom_employee_id or '' }}</div>
  <div class="info">Company Name : {{ employee.company or company_name }}</div>
  <div class="info">Datetime: {{ frappe.utils.format_datetime(doc.submission_datetime, "d MMMM yyyy hh:mm a") if doc.submission_datetime else frappe.utils.format_datetime(frappe.utils.now_datetime(), "d MMMM yyyy hh:mm a") }} [SYSTEM GENERATED]</div>
</article>

<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: SignFont;
    font-weight: 900 !important;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: DefaultSign;
  }
</style>

{% set distributor = frappe.get_doc("Distributor", doc.distributor ) %}
{% set company_names = [] %}
{%- if distributor.meril_company_table and distributor.meril_company_table|length > 0 -%}
    {%- for c in distributor.meril_company_table -%}
        {% if c.meril_company_name and c.meril_company_name not in company_names %}{% set _ = company_names.append(c.meril_company_name) %}{% endif %}
    {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{% set dynamic_company = company_names | join(', ') if company_names else 'Meril' %}

<article>
  <header>
     <div class="logo-container">
      <div class="logo-left-margin"></div>
      <div class="logo">
          <img class="meril" src="/assets/lms/images/meril.svg" alt="Meril" />
           <span class="more_to_life">More to Life</span>
        </div>
     </div>
    <h2 class="title">Distributor Declaration - Ethical Practices & Compliance <h2>
  </header>
      <p>I/We Distributor Company Name hereby declare that I/We have undergone and understood  training provided on Ethical Practices and compliance. As a distributor of {{ dynamic_company }}, I/We acknowledge and accept the duty  to comply with the  procedural frameworks developed and adopted by the {{ dynamic_company }}'s Management from time to time. 
I/We have been thoroughly informed on the various Code of Conduct that govern the ethical operation  of {{ dynamic_company }}'s business, which I/We agree to follow diligently. <br/>
I/We have read,  understood and consent to abide by the following Codes of Conduct on a consensus-ad-idem basis:
</p>
      
 <ol>
   <li>
  <pre>[ 1 ] : Anti Bribery and Anti Corruption Policy </pre>
   </li>
   <li>
    <pre>[ 2 ] : Export Controls and Trade Sanctions Policy </pre>
   </li>
   <li>
<pre>[ 3 ] : HCP & HCO Compliance framework </pre>
   </li>
   <li>
<pre>[ 4 ] : National Pharmaceutical Pricing Authority norms for capping of maximum retail price & maximum trade margin across all trade channels</pre>
   </li>
   <li>
      <prev>[ 5 ] : FCPA (Foreign Corrupt Practices Act) </pre>
      </li>
 </ol>
   
  <p>I/We further affirm and declare that, except for the current distributorship agreement, I/we have no direct or indirect familial, financial, or other relationships with any employee, their family member, relative, or nominated representative of the {{ dynamic_company }} Group, or with any entity within the {{ dynamic_company }} Group. Should I/we become aware of any such relationship in the future, I/we commit to disclosing it to {{ dynamic_company }} within thirty (30) days from the date of awareness
Additionally, I/We affirm and declare that I/we will not engage in any financial transactions with any employee, their family member, relative or nominated representative of the {{ dynamic_company }} Group. I/We acknowledge that {{ dynamic_company }} Group shall bear no responsibility or liability for any such transactions.
</p>
      
<p>I/We agree to fully comply with all ethical standards and behavioral expectations as outlined in the applicable Codes of Conduct and related policies. I/We understand that any actual or potential violation of these Codes or policies may constitute grounds for disciplinary action, including, but not limited to, termination of the Distributorship Agreement
I/We certify that I/We am/are not currently in violation of any of the aforementioned Codes of Conduct
</p>
      
<div class="info">
  Signature & Seal	: <span class="sign"> {{ doc.entered_name  }}</span> 
      <div class="seal">
       <div class="circle">
        <div class="text">
            {# compute how many characters we have #}
            {% set my_text = distributor.distributor_company_name + " • " %}
           {% set letters = my_text.replace(' ', ' ') | list %}
           {% set count = letters | length %}
           {% for char in letters %}
            {% set angle = (loop.index0 * 360) / count %}
            <span style="transform: rotate({{ angle }}deg)">{{ char }}</span>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <img class="ring" src="/assets/lms/images/seal-border.png" alt="seal" />
    </div>
  </div>
</div> 
<div class="info">
  Distributor Name : {{ distributor.distributor_name }}
</div>
<div class="info">Attendee Name : {{ distributor.attendee_name }}</div>
<div class="info">Submission Date / Completion Date: {{ frappe.utils.format_datetime( doc.submission_datetime, "d MMMM yyyy hh:mm a") }}</div>
</article>
