{% set distributor = frappe.get_doc("Distributor", doc.distributor) %}
{% set company_names = [] %}
{%- if distributor.meril_company_table and distributor.meril_company_table|length > 0 -%}
    {%- for c in distributor.meril_company_table -%}
        {% if c.meril_company_name and c.meril_company_name not in company_names %}{% set _ = company_names.append(c.meril_company_name) %}{% endif %}
    {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{% set dynamic_company = company_names | join(', ') if company_names else 'Meril' %}


<article>
  <header>
    <img src="/assets/lms/images/meril.svg" alt="meril-logo" />
    <h2 class="title">Distributor Declaration - Ethical Practices & Compliance</h2>
  </header>

  <p>
    I/We <strong>{{ distributor.distributor_company_name }}</strong> hereby declare that I/We have undergone and understood training provided on Ethical Practices and compliance. As a distributor of {{ dynamic_company }}, I/We acknowledge and accept the duty to comply with the procedural frameworks developed and adopted by the {{ dynamic_company }}'s Management from time to time.
    <br />
    I/We have been thoroughly informed on the various Code of Conduct that govern the ethical operation of {{ dynamic_company }}'s business, which I/We agree to follow diligently.
    <br />
    I/We have read, understood, and consent to abide by the following Codes of Conduct on a consensus-ad-idem basis:
  </p>

  <ol>
    <li><pre>[ 1 ] : Anti Bribery and Anti Corruption Policy</pre></li>
    <li><pre>[ 2 ] : Export Controls and Trade Sanctions Policy</pre></li>
    <li><pre>[ 3 ] : HCP & HCO Compliance framework</pre></li>
    <li><pre>[ 4 ] : National Pharmaceutical Pricing Authority norms for capping of maximum retail price & maximum trade margin across all trade channels</pre></li>
    <li><pre>[ 5 ] : FCPA (Foreign Corrupt Practices Act)</pre></li>
  </ol>

  <p>
    I/We further affirm and declare that, except for the current distributorship agreement, I/We have no direct or indirect familial, financial, or other relationships with any employee, their family member, relative, or nominated representative of the {{ dynamic_company }} Group, or with any entity within the {{ dynamic_company }} Group.
    <br />
    Should I/We become aware of any such relationship in the future, I/We commit to disclosing it to {{ dynamic_company }} within thirty (30) days from the date of awareness.
    <br />
    Additionally, I/We affirm and declare that I/We will not engage in any financial transactions with any employee, their family member, relative or nominated representative of the {{ dynamic_company }} Group. I/We acknowledge that {{ dynamic_company }} Group shall bear no responsibility or liability for any such transactions.
  </p>

  <p>
    I/We agree to fully comply with all ethical standards and behavioral expectations as outlined in the applicable Codes of Conduct and related policies. I/We understand that any actual or potential violation of these Codes or policies may constitute grounds for disciplinary action, including, but not limited to, termination of the Distributorship Agreement.
    <br />
    I/We certify that I/We am/are not currently in violation of any of the aforementioned Codes of Conduct.
  </p>

  <div class="info">
    Signature & Seal: <span class="sign"> </span>
       <div class="seal">
       <div class="circle">
        <div class="text">
            {# compute how many characters we have #}
            {% set my_text = distributor.distributor_company_name + " • " %}
           {% set letters = my_text.replace(' ', ' ') | list %}
           {% set count = letters | length %}
           {% for char in letters %}
            {% set angle = (loop.index0 * 360) / count %}
            <span style="-webkit-transform: rotate({{ angle }}deg)">{{ char }}</span>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <img class="ring" src="/assets/lms/images/seal-border.png" alt="seal" />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="info">
    Distributor Name: {{ distributor.distributor_name }}
  </div>
  <div class="info">
    Attendee Name: {{ distributor.attendee_name }}
  </div>
  <div class="info">
    Submission Date / Completion Date: {{ frappe.utils.format_datetime( doc.submission_datetime, "d MMMM yyyy hh:mm a") }}
  </div>
</article>

